# Bundle manifest (apex_add_bundle_tprms): one bundle per row --
#   <name> <componentId-hex> <role>=<repo-relative-source> [...]
# Roles come from the registered vocabulary (WorldBundle.hpp role
# table); the inner-format suffix rides from the same table. Rules:
# at least one entry per row, roles unique per row, sources exist at
# pack time, duplicate names refused (bundles are shared: every
# master embedding a bundle row packs the same product).
#
# earth carries the atmosphere table and the 1-degree terrain patch;
# adding an entry moves the pin every consumer of the world carries.
kind world

earth 0x0101 atmosphere=demos/apex_horizon_demo/aircraft_atmo/data/earth_ussa76.atm terrain=demos/apex_horizon_demo/rover_terrain/data/alpha_patch_lod4.htile
